write(V/'coverage-contract.md','# Coverage contract\n\nImplementation status is independent of verification status. Exact v2 bullet inventory: coverage-contract.json. No entry is inherited without a checked mapping.\n\n| ID | Lifecycle phase | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n'+'\n'.join(f"| {x['id']} | {x['requirement']} | required-in-this-model; not_run |" for x in items if x['id'].startswith('PH-'))+'\n\nContracts C-Decision, C-Local and C-Records are defined in properties.md. Immediate usability equality is O-Immediate and is expected to fail. General n-leg exchange, repo maturity, FX, netting and funding/redemption are excluded because no transitions are specified. Legal entitlement remains external.\n')
variants=[('A-tombstone','A-hosted native durable holds; signed abort tombstones'),('A-open','A-hosted; authenticated historical OPEN required for B'),('B-hosted','B hosts decision; cash delivered locally at COMMIT'),('D-shared','Distinct shared decision ledger, separate A/B preparation and return evidence'),('escrow','Custody-transfer reservations; control versus ownership distinguished'),('private','Private recipient notes/keys required for local usability'),('multilateral','Three independent institutions; two bilateral trades share capacity'),('htlc','Abstract two-party staggered HTLC; buyer holds secret'),('gpact','Narrow provisional effects/root decision/signalling'),('shared-execution','Both economic effects one local atomic transaction'),('committee','Honest/compromised threshold remote-fact authentication'),('auth-direct','Ideal canonical source-consensus + membership'),('auth-zk','Ideal ZK wrapper of canonical consensus/membership'),('auth-execution','Ideal execution validity plus canonical history')]
